# Gold tick dataset — bulk binary, exceeds GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit.
# The pipeline in research/gold_tick_data/dukascopy/code/ rebuilds all of it
# from Dukascopy in ~15 minutes, and logs/manifest_by_hour.csv carries a SHA256
# for every raw file, so the artefacts are reproducible rather than stored.
research/gold_tick_data/dukascopy/raw/
research/gold_tick_data/dukascopy/processed/*.parquet
research/gold_tick_data/dukascopy/processed/*.csv.gz
research/gold_tick_data/dukascopy/processed/parts/
